        "mission_intent": "Team, we need to stand up an integrated continuous monitoring report that covers our security event detection and incident management posture across the enterprise. Specifically, I want a consolidated weekly summary that pulls from our IDS/IPS alerts, endpoint malware protection logs, firewall events, and operating system audit logs from both server and workstation tiers. The report should categorize events by source type\u2014security software, OS-level, network equipment, and application-generated\u2014and flag any entries that meet the threshold for a security incident as defined by our acceptable use and computer security policies. For each incident-level event, include detection method (signature-based versus anomaly-based), time to detection, and response actions taken or recommended. I also need a section that evaluates whether our current logging mechanisms provide adequate coverage across all network segments and system components. Please coordinate with the NOC and the incident response team to validate data sources and ensure nothing is falling through the cracks. I'd like the first iteration ready for leadership review by end of next week.",
